---
title: "Pick one number and obsess"
description: "Ten dashboards is how you avoid the metric that hurts."
date: "2026-07-24"
tags:
  - growth
  - saas
published: true
layout: docs
---

Founders love dashboards. Twelve charts. Zero decisions.

I run Algility off one number at a time. Qualified pipeline. Cash collected. Hours saved for a client. Whatever the stage needs. Everything else is noise wearing a suit.

When the number is up, keep doing the thing. When it's flat, change the thing. Don't invent a new KPI so you can feel productive.

Simple scoreboards create simple behavior. Simple behavior scales.
